OL,3,GNEWSAMayors could be given powers to
OL,4,Aoversee water companies
OL,5,
OL,6,FMayors and other local political
OL,7,Fleaders could be given powers to
OL,8,Foversee water companies under plans
OL,9,Fbeing considered by the government.
OL,11,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham's plan is
OL,12,Fto create nine new regional bodies
OL,13,Fresponsible for planning, setting
OL,14,Fobjectives, and holding water companies
OL,15,Fto account.
OL,17,FThe idea, first reported by The
OL,18,FTelegraph, was a key recommendation of
OL,19,FSir John Cunliffe's Independent Water
OL,20,FCommission published in June last year.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
