OL,3,GNEWSAMayors could be given powers to
OL,4,Aoversee water companies
OL,5,
OL,6,FImproving the water industry has been a
OL,7,Ffocus for Burnham since he took to
OL,8,Fpower, as water customers in England
OL,9,Fand Wales continue to face steep bill
OL,10,Fhikes.
